    MainContainer->>AutoLevelingModal: Opens auto leveling modal
    MainContainer->>ContributeIdentifyModal: Opens identify modal
    MainContainer->>ContributeCreatureLoreModal: Opens lore modal
    MainContainer->>ScriptingHelpModal: Opens scripting help
    Note over MainContainer,GameConnection: Connection events dispatched
    GameConnection->>PluginHost: Notifies of connection changes
    PluginHost->>PluginHost: Updates plugin state
